5","text":"穆弟儉，寧遠將軍、頓丘太守。建義初，除太府少卿。尋為華州中正，加左將軍。儉與元顥有舊，及顥入洛，受其位任。莊帝還宮，坐免。後以本將軍潁州刺史，尋加散騎常侍、平南將軍，州罷不行。普泰初，除征南將軍、金紫光祿大夫。永熙中，以本將軍除北雍州刺史，仍陷關西。","text_layer":"received_chapter","annotation_status":"in_progress","source_position":{"revision_id":2087998,"raw_start":14160,"raw_end":14323,"source_layer":"received_biography","raw_character_offsets":[14160,14161,14162,14163,14164,14165,14166,14167,14168,14169,14170,14171,14172,14173,14174,14175,14176,14177,14178,14179,14180,14181,14182,14183,14184,14185,14186,14187,14188,14189,14190,14191,14192,14193,14194,14195,14196,14197,14198,14199,14200,14201,14202,14203,14204,14205,14206,14207,14208,14209,14210,14211,14212,14213,14214,14215,14216,14217,14218,14219,14220,14221,14222,14223,14224,14225,14226,14227,14228,14229,14230,14269,14270,14271,14272,14273,14274,14275,14276,14277,14278,14279,14280,14281,14282,14283,14284,14285,14286,14287,14288,14289,14290,14291,14292,14293,14294,14295,14296,14297,14298,14299,14300,14301,14302,14303,14304,14305,14306,14307,14308,14309,14310,14311,14312,14313,14314,14315,14316,14317,14318,14319,14320,14321,14322],"projection_sha256":"18be64e4cd777da323eb37c4405ee02f65df58ce95bb6211f59a88256a4d9544"},"mentions":[{"id":"c-weishu-weishou-058-yangjin:p025:m0000","kind":"person","start":0,"end":1,"surface":"穆","person_id":"7hw_8jq_c1e_AAB","status":"contextual_provisional","human_reviewed":false,"reviewer":"Codex（AI代理）","interpretation_note":"依本完整來源單元具名與角色時序；逐項身份資格見identity-review。"},{"id":"c-weishu-weishou-058-yangjin:p025:m0002","kind":"person","start":2,"end":3,"surface":"儉","person_id":"7hw_8jq_c1e_AAC","status":"contextual_provisional","human_reviewed":false,"reviewer":"Codex（AI代理）","interpretation_note":"依本完整來源單元具名與角色時序；逐項身份資格見identity-review。"},{"id":"c-weishu-weishou-058-yangjin:p025:m0036","kind":"person","start":36,"end":37,"surface":"儉","person_id":"7hw_8jq_c1e_AAC","status":"contextual_provisional","human_reviewed":false,"reviewer":"Codex（AI代理）","interpretation_note":"依本完整來源單元具名與角色時序；逐項身份資格見identit